@startuml drone-networking-sequence
title drone-networking: Startup & Hot-Reload Sequence

actor Operator
participant "Docker Engine" as Docker
participant "entrypoint.sh" as EP
participant "netplan/networkd" as Netplan
participant "hostapd" as HAP
participant "dnsmasq" as DNS
participant "avahi-daemon" as Avahi
participant "Watcher" as Watcher
participant "wifi.json" as Config

== Container Startup ==
Docker -> EP : start (env: AP_SSID, AP_PASS, MDNS_HOSTNAME)
EP -> EP : [1/7] Load drone_log.sh, read envs
EP -> Netplan : [2/7] Apply /etc/netplan/50-drone.yaml
Netplan --> EP : Ethernet static IPs + wlan0 DHCP configured
EP -> EP : [3/7] rfkill unblock wifi; ip link set wlan0 up
EP -> Netplan : [4/7] Read wlan0 DHCP IP (station managed by networkd)
Netplan --> EP : WIFI_IP (or empty if disconnected)
EP -> EP : [5/7] "iw dev wlan0 link" detect freq\nAuto-select channel + hw_mode (2.4/5 GHz)
EP -> EP : Create virtual AP iface uap0\nip addr add AP_IP dev uap0
EP -> EP : Generate /tmp/hostapd.conf (SSID/band/channel)
EP -> DNS : [6/7] dnsmasq -C /tmp/dnsmasq.conf -d
DNS --> EP : DNSMASQ_PID
EP -> Avahi : configure avahi-daemon.conf (no D-Bus)\npublish MDNS_HOSTNAME.local
Avahi --> EP : AVAHI_PID
EP -> HAP : hostapd -d /tmp/hostapd.conf
HAP --> EP : HOSTAPD_PID
EP -> Watcher : [7/7] watch_wifi_contract() background loop\npoll wifi.json every 3s
EP -> EP : trap cleanup SIGTERM/SIGINT; wait HOSTAPD_PID

== Hot-Reload: Hotspot Config Change ==
Operator -> Config : Edit wifi.json (hotspot.ssid / hotspot.password)
Watcher -> Config : detect mtime change
Watcher -> Watcher : parse new AP_SSID/AP_PASS via python3 json
Watcher -> HAP : killall -9 hostapd
HAP --> Watcher : terminated
Watcher -> EP : sed -i update /tmp/hostapd.conf
Watcher -> HAP : restart hostapd -d /tmp/hostapd.conf
HAP --> Watcher : new HOSTAPD_PID

note over Watcher : STA credentials owned by netplan/networkd.\nWatcher logs warning only; does NOT touch wpa_supplicant.

== Graceful Shutdown ==
Docker -> EP : SIGTERM
EP -> Watcher : kill -9 WATCHER_PID
EP -> DNS : kill -9 DNSMASQ_PID
EP -> Avahi : kill -9 AVAHI_PID
EP -> HAP : killall -9 hostapd
EP -> EP : iw dev uap0 del; exit 0


note as DeploymentContract
  Source/config: GitHub pull
  Image: GHCR linux/arm64
  Pi update: compose pull + up --no-build
  Private runtime config/state stays outside Git
end note

@enduml
